# Claude Code: local working config and instructions, not part of the project
.claude/
/CLAUDE.md

# Build output
/build/

# Test instances are fetched and checksum-verified, never committed
# (PLAN 2.10). bench/netlib.manifest is what pins them; the files
# themselves stay out, licences and size both.
/bench/instances/

# Acceptance results ARE committed (PLAN 2.9): every figure in them —
# status, objective, iterations, work units — is deterministic (D8), so the
# record reproduces on any machine and a diff of it is the history of what
# the solver did to the reference set. No wall-clock number is in there to
# make it host-specific (D17).
